570
00:17:08,365 --> 00:17:10,934
AND I AM FROM LOS ANGELES,
CALIFORNIA.

571
00:17:10,934 --> 00:17:13,738
EVERYTHING THAT HAPPENS TO ME,
I APPRECIATE IT,

572
00:17:13,738 --> 00:17:15,039
EVEN IF IT'S LIKE
THE SMALLEST LITTLE THING.

573
00:17:15,039 --> 00:17:16,240
I GET EXCITED
OVER, LIKE,

574
00:17:16,240 --> 00:17:18,576
THE STUPIDEST GOOD THINGS
THAT HAPPEN TO ME.

575
00:17:18,576 --> 00:17:19,577
SO WHAT'S THIS ABOUT

576
00:17:19,577 --> 00:17:20,978
YOUR RELATIONSHIP
