579
00:17:27,218 --> 00:17:28,819
SHE JUST, LIKE,
SHE WAS--

580
00:17:28,819 --> 00:17:30,521
I'M SORRY, BUT SHE
WAS REALLY SELFISH,

581
00:17:30,521 --> 00:17:33,124
AND I THINK SHE HAS
SO MUCH FRUSTRATION

582
00:17:33,124 --> 00:17:34,157
INSIDE OF HER.

583
00:17:34,157 --> 00:17:35,459
WHEN I DID SOMETHING,
LIKE,

584
