SMALL OR WRONG,
IT WAS LIKE, HUGE.

585
00:17:37,528 --> 00:17:39,563
LIKE, SHE JUST, LIKE,
TOOK IT OUT ON ME HARDCORE.

586
00:17:39,563 --> 00:17:40,998
I REMEMBER, I WOULD
ALWAYS JUST BE LIKE,

587
00:17:40,998 --> 00:17:42,133
"WHY IS THIS
HAPPENING TO ME?"

588
00:17:42,133 --> 00:17:44,401
AND I, LIKE, I
WOULD PRAY.

589
00:17:44,401 --> 00:17:46,837
I KNEW AT THAT MOMENT THAT
