00:18:07,792 --> 00:18:11,262
I AM THE STRONGEST
PERSON IN THIS WHOLE THING.

605
00:18:11,262 --> 00:18:13,230
I HAVE DEALT WITH EVERYTHING
THAT COULD BE

606
00:18:13,230 --> 00:18:15,332
THROWN MY
WAY ALL AT ONCE,

607
00:18:15,332 --> 00:18:16,734
SO NO ONE'S GONNA
STOP ME.

608
00:18:16,734 --> 00:18:17,601
