THAT MAKES ME WHO I AM.

615
00:18:30,080 --> 00:18:31,749
♪♪♪

616
00:18:31,749 --> 00:18:34,518
WORK IT,
WORK IT, WORK IT.

617
00:18:34,518 --> 00:18:35,886
I'M IN LOVE WITH
THIS GIRL.

618
00:18:35,886 --> 00:18:37,822
I THINK SHE'S THE SWEETEST
THING IN THE WORLD.

619
00:18:37,822 --> 00:18:39,657
