624
00:18:45,496 --> 00:18:47,298
I DON'T THINK
THAT THIS WORKS.

625
00:18:47,298 --> 00:18:48,632
THIS IS LIKE THE BEST PART
OF THE DAY,

626
00:18:48,632 --> 00:18:49,700
I'M, "NOM NOM."

627
00:18:49,700 --> 00:18:51,602
THIS RAMEN
TASTES LIKE HAY.

628
00:18:51,602 --> 00:18:53,103
IT TASTES LIKE HAY.

