00:18:53,103 --> 00:18:54,305
LIKE STRAW HAY.

630
00:18:54,305 --> 00:18:55,439
IT'S REALLY BAD.

631
00:18:55,439 --> 00:18:56,307
NO, IT'S BAD.

632
00:18:56,307 --> 00:18:57,308
THAT'S WHY I'M
COMPLAINING.

633
00:18:57,308 --> 00:18:58,309
