YOU ABOUT--

638
00:19:04,782 --> 00:19:06,617
NO, NICOLE,

639
00:19:06,617 --> 00:19:09,186
YOU HAVE BEEN COMPLAINING
THE WHOLE TIME.

640
00:19:09,186 --> 00:19:10,187
