COMPLAINING...

653
00:19:27,938 --> 00:19:29,340
THE BEAUTY BUSINESS CAN
BE QUITE UGLY,

654
00:19:29,340 --> 00:19:31,475
BECAUSE OF HOW
CATTY PEOPLE GET.

655
00:19:31,475 --> 00:19:33,844
NO, IT'S YOU WHO WAS
COMPLAINING ABOUT CHIPS...

656
00:19:33,844 --> 00:19:35,813
GIRLS ARE STARTING TO
GET BITCHY AND LIKE,

657
00:19:35,813 --> 00:19:37,748
COMPETITIVE AND,
LIKE, DRAMATIC.

658
00:19:41,719 --> 00:19:44,855
WE'RE CONSTANTLY HEARING
NICOLE COMPLAIN.

659
00:19:44,855 --> 00:19:46,090
YOU DON'T
EVEN KNOW ME.

660
00:19:46,090 --> 00:19:47,691
