672
00:20:03,040 --> 00:20:04,708
♪♪♪

673
00:20:07,478 --> 00:20:08,979
♪♪♪

674
00:20:12,149 --> 00:20:13,350
HI.

675
00:20:13,350 --> 00:20:14,285
