685
00:20:27,064 --> 00:20:28,032
I THINK THEY'RE REAL.

686
00:20:28,032 --> 00:20:30,901
YEAH, I WAS MADE FUN OF
ALL THROUGH HIGH SCHOOL.

687
00:20:30,901 --> 00:20:32,937
I WANT YOU TO EXPLAIN
A LITTLE BIT ABOUT

688
00:20:32,937 --> 00:20:34,004
