WITH MODELING.

689
00:20:34,004 --> 00:20:35,806
GOT MY FIRST JOB,
AND I SAVED UP MONEY

690
00:20:35,806 --> 00:20:37,408
UNTIL I COULD AFFORD
TO GO TO A CONVENTION.

691
00:20:37,408 --> 00:20:38,709
HOW MUCH WAS THAT?

692
00:20:38,709 --> 00:20:40,311
NEAR $1,000 OR $1,500--

693
00:20:40,311 --> 00:20:42,379
$1,500 FOR
A MODELING CONVENTION?

694
00:20:42,379 --> 00:20:43,981
A LOT... ANYWAYS.

695
00:20:43,981 --> 00:20:45,316
YOU SHOULD NEVER
HAVE TO PAY SOMEONE

696
00:20:45,316 --> 00:20:46,750
TO TELL YOU WHETHER
OR NOT YOU HAVE

697
00:20:46,750 --> 00:20:47,985
WHAT IT TAKES
TO BE A MODEL.

698
00:20:47,985 --> 00:20:49,586
MOST OF THESE THINGS
ARE SCAMS,

699
00:20:49,586 --> 00:20:50,487
AND THAT'S
WHY YOU'RE STANDING

700
00:20:50,487 --> 00:20:52,323
IN FRONT OF US TODAY
AND STILL TRYING

701
00:20:52,323 --> 00:20:54,425
TO BE A MODEL,
BECAUSE IT DIDN'T WORK.

702
00:20:54,425 --> 00:20:56,126
I THINK WHAT WILL
MAKE ME SHINE OVER

703
00:20:56,126 --> 00:20:59,129
THE OTHER GIRLS IS
I'M HONEST AND I'M REAL

704
00:20:59,129 --> 00:21:01,265
AND I ALSO HAVE
BIG ASS LIPS.

705
00:21:01,265 --> 00:21:02,833
(laughing)
I THINK THAT HELPS.

706
00:21:02,833 --> 00:21:05,202
♪♪♪

707
00:21:05,202 --> 00:21:07,137
